  startingNodeID: Greetings0
  nodes:
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Greetings0
    nextNodeID: Greetings1
    text: 'Hey! You there, the dashing traveler! '
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Zenon
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Greetings1
    nextNodeID: Greetings2
    text: Yeah, you, the one who just looked my way! Come on over here for a sec!
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Zenon
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Greetings2
    nextNodeID: ImGood
    text: "Look at some of the gorgeous and rare stuff I\u2019m selling."
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Zenon
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: ImGood
    nextNodeID: Disappointment
    text: "Oh, I\u2019m not here to buy something, sorry."
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Ceryx
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Disappointment
    nextNodeID: Flood
    text: "How disappointing. \u2026Well, it\u2019s okay. I\u2019m not upset towards
      you, because I\u2019m used to this at this point."
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Zenon
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Flood
    nextNodeID: Info0
    text: "I don\u2019t get as many customers as I used to after the flood. God of
      the sea was surely angry towards us Athens."
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 0
    speakerName: Zenon
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Info0
    nextNodeID: Info1
    text: "You know\u2026 we used to be a small rural area with a close community."
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 0
    speakerName: Zenon
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Info1
    nextNodeID: Info2
    text: However, production of crops dropped recently, and people stopped showing
      generosity towards each other. The contract that Cranaus has with individual
      farmers made matters worse.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 0
    speakerName: Zenon
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Info2
    nextNodeID: WrapUp
    text: Lydos has been in a bad relationship with Artopoios and Aigidios because
      Lydos broke his promise several times with Artopoios and Aigidios to keep his
      contract with Cranaus.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Zenon
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: WrapUp
    nextNodeID: ComeAgain
    text: "\u2026Anyways, there are a lot more things going on in this town than
      you can just see with your eyes."
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Zenon
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 1
    id: ComeAgain
    nextNodeID: 
    text: "Please come again whenever you\u2019d like to purchase something here."
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Zenon
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
